SF0120 Wyoming PRIME act.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Salazar, Hutchings and Pearson and
Representative(s) Andrew, Banks, Brady, Brown, G,
Hoeft, Lien, McCann, Neiman, Schmid, Styvar, Webb,
Webber and Wharff
AN ACT relating to marketing homemade foods; providing for the sale of producer-
raised, homemade meat products as specified; providing a delayed effective date
pending certification by the governor based on federal action; providing
definitions; authorizing rulemaking; and providing for an effective date.
